  * DEEPCRAFT(TM) Ready Model archives, *_lib_eval.a  (§2.4) - evaluation
    licence forbids distribution.
  * Infineon face-identification library, ifx_face_id  (see THIRD_PARTY.md) -
    the Cypress grant carries no distribution right.
  * Infineon face-identification application_code/  (see THIRD_PARTY.md) -
    carries no licence grant of any kind, only a prohibition.
